        "text_t7ag8L": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Blue sapphire, a prized member of the corundum family, is renowned for its striking blue color, which can range from light sky blue to intense, velvety, or deep navy hues. This captivating color is primarily due to the presence of trace elements like iron and titanium within the crystal structure. Known for its exceptional hardness, second only to diamonds, blue sapphire is highly durable, making it perfect for creating timeless jewelry that endures through the years.</p>",
            "text_style": "body"
          }
        }
