        "text_83rbDx": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>While blue sapphire is the most well-known, sapphires are available in a stunning array of colors, each offering its own unique charm and appeal. At Shamballa Jewels, we also offer:<br/><br/><strong>Pink sapphires</strong>, with their soft and romantic hues, range from pastel pinks to vibrant magentas, adding a playful elegance to any jewelry piece. <br/><a href=\"/collections/pink-sapphire\" title=\"Pink Sapphire\">Find your perfect pink sapphire today</a></p><p><strong>Brown sapphires</strong> offer warm, earthy tones from light champagne to deep coffee, providing a versatile beauty that suits both modern and classic designs. <br/><a href=\"/collections/brown-sapphires\" title=\"Brown sapphires\">Discover our brown sapphire jewelry now</a></p><p><strong>Yellow sapphires</strong> shine with bright, sunny hues from pale lemon to rich canary yellow, bringing a lively sparkle to your collection. <br/><a href=\"/collections/yellow-sapphire\" title=\"yellow sapphire\">Shop our yellow sapphires for a pop of color!</a></p><p><strong>Green sapphires</strong> capture nature’s essence with shades from soft moss to deep forest green, offering a distinct, earthy elegance.<a href=\"/collections/green-sapphire\" title=\"green sapphire\"> Explore our green sapphire jewelry</a></p><p><strong>Grey sapphires</strong>, with their misty hues from silver to smoky charcoal, add a modern, sophisticated edge to any look. <a href=\"/collections/grey-sapphire\" title=\"Grey sapphire\">Elevate your style with grey sapphire pieces now</a></p><p>Each sapphire color has its own unique story and aesthetic, allowing you to find the perfect gemstone to reflect your personal style and taste.</p>",
            "text_style": "subtitle"
          }
